WEBVTT

00:05.630 --> 00:09.860
Everyone is acknowledging that you are
the first founder and looking at you.

00:10.600 --> 00:14.120
Who are you? Is this Psycho Helmet-san?

00:14.660 --> 00:18.360
How do you like all that clapping and
cheering you've never experienced before?

00:19.250 --> 00:21.940
Well? Doesn't it feel great?

00:22.840 --> 00:24.710
No, not at all.

00:26.310 --> 00:31.330
Let's talk face to face.
I'm at the base of the broccoli.

00:31.330 --> 00:34.920
Damn it, it's not a broccoli anymore.

00:35.420 --> 00:39.590
Because this thing absorbed all
those emotions from those people,

00:39.590 --> 00:42.070
it turned into something
completely different.

00:42.680 --> 00:46.500
Have you ever strongly
believed in something?

00:47.840 --> 00:54.740
The aggregation of powerful belief
can sometimes manifest into reality.

00:55.310 --> 00:58.650
A great change is about
to happen in this world.

00:59.060 --> 01:03.430
A new god named Psycho Helmet

01:03.430 --> 01:06.760
is going to take physical form and ascend.

01:07.840 --> 01:08.910
God?

01:09.720 --> 01:12.010
You're just a coordinator for this group.

01:12.370 --> 01:18.470
I'm going to claim that Psycho Helmet is
the reincarnation of their great creator.

01:19.880 --> 01:25.230
I will lead the people down the right
path and give their hearts peace.

01:25.680 --> 01:27.550
The right path?

01:27.980 --> 01:32.020
Is giving people peace of mind even effective?

01:32.020 --> 01:34.530
Who the hell knows?
I'm just making shit up.

01:35.880 --> 01:40.620
Just pray five minutes a day
towards the Divine Tree.

01:41.110 --> 01:43.950
That becomes my sustenance.

01:46.700 --> 01:51.890
The followers will figure out the rest for me
with however they interpret this.

01:56.230 --> 01:58.800
You look like you have
something you want to say.

01:58.800 --> 02:02.560
But look, the believers are
all having a great time, too.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.970
Including Ritsu and Reigen...

02:07.590 --> 02:10.400
Whoops. He was an exception, though.

02:10.690 --> 02:14.730
He figured me out before anyone else
and tried to shut all this down first.

02:15.610 --> 02:19.320
In the end, the ones
who have the most fun win.

02:20.520 --> 02:25.590
So you're the one who had
Master Reigen say that...

02:26.550 --> 02:27.720
Dimple.

04:04.560 --> 04:07.530
Now, don't be so mad.

04:07.530 --> 04:09.010
Hanazawa's fine.

04:10.100 --> 04:13.930
More importantly, join the
Psycho Helmet Religion.

04:13.930 --> 04:18.200
You and I can stand at the top
and have a blast together.

04:18.750 --> 04:19.910
Why?

04:19.910 --> 04:24.600
By the looks of it,
you're already powerful enough.

04:24.950 --> 04:27.990
You still have potential to grow.

04:27.990 --> 04:33.540
Looking at the future, I figured it'd be a
waste not to take advantage of that power.

04:33.540 --> 04:34.660
I refuse.

04:36.900 --> 04:39.620
Well, I figured that'd
be your answer for now.

04:39.910 --> 04:44.610
But your family, your friends,
and everyone else...

04:45.280 --> 04:49.230
already live in a world where
they experience happiness

04:49.230 --> 04:52.150
through their faith in Psycho Helmet-sama.

04:52.970 --> 04:58.300
You're the only one left behind
in this city, Shigeo.

04:58.990 --> 05:01.960
No one's ever coming back.

05:01.960 --> 05:04.350
How long are you gonna be stubborn?

05:04.780 --> 05:10.260
They're all just being brainwashed by you.
You're the one who needs to give up.

05:10.260 --> 05:11.650
You mad?

05:11.900 --> 05:13.140
I am.

05:13.790 --> 05:15.110
Of course I'm mad.

05:15.790 --> 05:18.290
Return everyone to their senses now.

05:18.290 --> 05:20.560
You even got to Ritsu and Master Reigen...

05:20.560 --> 05:22.320
How did you manage that?

05:23.000 --> 05:26.600
The first stage was to have
them touch the Divine Tree

05:26.600 --> 05:29.760
or have them ingest a bit of it somehow.

05:30.080 --> 05:33.850
I got into their minds
through physical contact.

05:34.430 --> 05:40.380
The second stage was to expose the few
left behind to the passion of the masses.

05:41.130 --> 05:43.060
That's how I got to Reigen, too.

05:43.570 --> 05:46.530
He was overwhelmed by his surroundings.

05:47.870 --> 05:51.310
And now, we've entered the third stage.

05:51.690 --> 05:58.120
That strong feeling of faith transmits
from one person to another.

05:58.120 --> 06:03.500
It's only a matter of time till everyone
in the country believes in Psycho Helmet.

06:04.070 --> 06:06.230
Then it'll really be something.

06:06.630 --> 06:10.170
Then I'll truly become a new god.

06:10.610 --> 06:15.140
I don't really get all this, but becoming
a god is even more pointless.

06:15.730 --> 06:18.560
Do you really not understand
what you're doing?

06:18.560 --> 06:19.360
Huh?

06:19.770 --> 06:22.100
The whole city's a mess.

06:22.100 --> 06:23.470
The city?

06:23.470 --> 06:28.600
I didn't know that, but we can
just rebuild it all later.

06:28.850 --> 06:31.700
That's enough.
Just undo their brainwashing.

06:31.960 --> 06:36.400
This isn't like you. You're being
very sentimental and narrow-minded.

06:36.880 --> 06:40.490
You keep calling it brainwashing,
but it's actually not that bad.

06:40.890 --> 06:43.720
It's not like I changed any
of their personalities,

06:43.720 --> 06:47.100
much less their hobbies
or the things they like.

06:47.620 --> 06:48.800
The way that Ritsu, Reigen,

06:49.450 --> 06:54.010
and everyone in the Body Improvement Club
feel about you isn't going to change either.

06:54.280 --> 06:58.100
You're all just going to become
followers of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

06:58.890 --> 07:00.190
And...

07:00.450 --> 07:06.150
You'll feel happiness in that and be able to
share that happiness with other believers.

07:06.610 --> 07:10.650
I'm not trying to exclude
you from the fun here.

07:11.640 --> 07:12.610
So...

07:12.610 --> 07:14.910
What, exactly, is your problem?

07:16.290 --> 07:18.290
What am I doing wrong?

07:21.800 --> 07:23.720
What are you doing wrong?

07:24.160 --> 07:26.890
Dimple, you're playing dirty.

07:27.510 --> 07:30.530
You're controlling people's
hearts with your power.

07:30.530 --> 07:33.850
That means they can't defy you and you
can make them do whatever you want.

07:34.670 --> 07:38.920
We live in a world where there
are laws and societal norms

07:38.920 --> 07:41.140
that we can't defy to begin with.

07:41.410 --> 07:45.240
If you're oblivious to them,
you don't have any problems.

07:45.500 --> 07:48.360
Not to mention, should I not listen to you,

07:48.360 --> 07:51.750
won't you just resort to force
at the end of the day?

07:51.950 --> 07:54.120
Sure, but I don't have a choice...

07:54.120 --> 07:57.480
Because my family and friends
are being brainwashed.

07:58.680 --> 08:02.500
Believe it or not, I'm restraining
myself quite a bit right now.

08:03.230 --> 08:04.880
Wait, Kageyama-kun.

08:05.220 --> 08:09.500
What Dimple-kun's doing isn't exactly evil.

08:09.500 --> 08:10.200
What?

08:10.450 --> 08:12.120
Think about this rationally.

08:12.120 --> 08:16.030
If you choose violence just because
you don't agree with him, it's over.

08:16.460 --> 08:19.480
No, there's still time.

08:19.480 --> 08:22.850
The Psycho Helmet Religion still
hasn't officially begun.

08:23.470 --> 08:26.380
No. If you put your hands
on him, it's all over.

08:26.790 --> 08:29.080
Your relationship with Dimple-kun...

08:29.790 --> 08:32.360
Our friendship will all be over.

08:33.440 --> 08:37.960
If you're going to forcibly tear
apart the Psycho Helmet Religion,

08:38.510 --> 08:40.480
I'm going to stop you.

08:41.160 --> 08:43.500
Even if you defeat me,

08:43.500 --> 08:47.080
your little brother and Reigen-san aren't
going to let you get away with this.

08:47.490 --> 08:50.910
Eventually, everyone will stand in your way.

08:51.410 --> 08:53.720
Dimple, you...

08:54.680 --> 08:57.460
Hanazawa doesn't have any
bad intentions, either.

08:57.460 --> 09:01.230
He's just trying to get you to change your
mind because he truly cares about you.

09:01.460 --> 09:04.600
I told you, even if you don't do
anything, everyone's daily lives—

09:07.380 --> 09:11.610
Dimple, come out.
I want to talk to you face to face.

09:11.610 --> 09:13.440
Stop this, Kageyama-kun!

09:14.010 --> 09:17.070
We've been talking this whole time.

09:19.730 --> 09:23.450
If you're going to harm the
Psycho Helmet Religion or the Divine Tree...

09:23.450 --> 09:24.950
then you'll have to deal with me!

09:38.130 --> 09:40.960
Hanazawa-kun! Snap out of it!

09:41.190 --> 09:43.880
Unfortunately for you,
I'm not controlling him.

09:44.100 --> 09:46.800
I've just gained another
important thing in my life.

09:46.800 --> 09:50.660
I'm going to keep fighting you until
you give up and leave, Kageyama-kun.

09:52.950 --> 09:54.050
I'm sorry.

10:05.730 --> 10:07.340
Dimple, show yourself!

10:16.420 --> 10:19.840
Those who believe are
blessed with divinity.

10:19.840 --> 10:22.660
Hanazawa has godly powers right now.

10:23.700 --> 10:26.640
I'm overflowing with power...

10:33.720 --> 10:37.180
Hana...zawa-kun...

10:38.710 --> 10:39.520
I'm sorry.

10:53.010 --> 10:57.170
Oh, no. I ended up hurting
the Divine Tree again.

10:57.360 --> 10:59.560
Well done, Hanazawa.

10:59.560 --> 11:04.080
Shigeo, if you let the Divine Tree's
roots embrace you and cool down,

11:04.080 --> 11:06.310
you'll change your mind, too.

11:08.670 --> 11:10.350
Such incredible power...

11:12.150 --> 11:14.100
The broccoli's roots?

11:21.460 --> 11:23.660
These roots are dangerous...

11:24.150 --> 11:26.760
Get away from here, Hanazawa-kun!

11:30.500 --> 11:32.480
Seriously, Kageyama-kun?!

11:32.480 --> 11:34.830
Psycho Helmet-sama, get behind me!

11:42.980 --> 11:47.460
W-Wow... You really are amazing!

11:54.130 --> 11:58.880
Aw, damn it. Now you opened
a hole in the Divine Tree.

11:59.330 --> 12:01.630
I mean, it'll close right back up anyway...

12:04.400 --> 12:10.490
I guess becoming a god isn't
so easy after all, Shigeo.

12:11.140 --> 12:12.040
It's futile.

12:29.530 --> 12:32.450
Dimple, why?

12:33.280 --> 12:35.730
Why won't you show yourself?

12:46.660 --> 12:47.850
Could it be...

12:51.400 --> 12:53.490
You're scared of me?

13:18.020 --> 13:19.590
Are we going to continue?

13:22.000 --> 13:25.080
Enough. That's enough.

13:26.090 --> 13:28.250
Don't make me feel like this.

13:29.000 --> 13:31.760
Don't you get it, Dimple?

13:33.650 --> 13:35.230
Come out, please.

13:37.190 --> 13:38.520
Or else...

14:11.650 --> 14:15.370
My powers... are being sucked away.

14:16.710 --> 14:18.160
Correct.

14:18.970 --> 14:22.200
You probably should've noticed
that a <i>wee</i> bit earlier.

14:25.620 --> 14:32.050
It was a mistake to let yourself
be lured into the Divine Tree.

14:39.010 --> 14:41.620
But your biggest mistake...

14:43.940 --> 14:46.900
was defying me.

14:47.780 --> 14:51.160
Dimple... What's the meaning of this?!

14:51.400 --> 14:53.770
Cool your head a bit.

14:53.770 --> 14:56.110
If you're not gonna listen to me,

14:56.110 --> 14:57.860
I might just get <i>her</i> to tell you.

14:57.860 --> 14:58.770
Huh?

14:58.770 --> 15:02.080
If I have Tsubomi-chan convince you...

15:02.080 --> 15:04.590
maybe you'll finally cool off a bit.

15:04.930 --> 15:09.600
Mob-kun! You can't go causing trouble for
everyone in the Psycho Helmet Religion!

15:10.040 --> 15:12.290
Get a clue already!

15:12.290 --> 15:13.630
You know?

15:19.260 --> 15:20.470
Hey, now...

15:21.120 --> 15:26.300
You get so serious anytime
Tsubomi-chan is involved.

15:27.340 --> 15:30.150
While we're at it, I guess I'll
just finally break it to ya.

15:30.150 --> 15:34.120
Shigeo, you've got no chance with her.

15:34.420 --> 15:35.410
Huh?

15:38.430 --> 15:43.550
Takane Tsubomi is the type of person to
honestly say she doesn't want something.

15:44.230 --> 15:48.760
I tried to forcefully give her one of the
candies, but she batted his hand away.

15:49.990 --> 15:52.380
Even when I used her friends
to get through to her,

15:52.380 --> 15:54.250
she wasn't interested.

15:56.210 --> 16:00.530
She's a strong woman who
doesn't conform to others

16:00.530 --> 16:02.340
and lives by her own set of values.

16:02.910 --> 16:04.800
No wonder she never even noticed you

16:04.800 --> 16:07.130
when you used your psychic
powers in front of her.

16:07.670 --> 16:13.150
Even if you get shredded,
I'm sure she'll never need you.

16:14.450 --> 16:20.190
But now... She's also part of
the Psycho Helmet Religion.

16:21.850 --> 16:27.870
Meaning you might just be able to win
her over as the great founder Shigeo.

16:30.250 --> 16:31.710
This is stupid.

16:32.610 --> 16:33.830
Wow...

16:34.790 --> 16:37.930
I thought we already took
most of your powers...

16:37.930 --> 16:40.740
But I guess you've still got some left.

16:42.330 --> 16:46.640
Maybe I shouldn't have
shown myself just yet.

16:47.520 --> 16:52.100
Well, whatever. It's not like
I'd lose to you right no—

16:53.810 --> 16:55.070
W-Wait...

16:55.600 --> 16:57.410
N-Now, wait a minute...

17:05.590 --> 17:07.750
Don't get ahead of yourself, damn it!

17:07.750 --> 17:10.330
This is how you repay my kindness?!

17:10.640 --> 17:15.210
I guess I'm just gonna have
to get serious, too.

17:23.010 --> 17:24.880
Watch closely.

17:25.400 --> 17:30.310
This... is the newly, happily reborn...

17:30.960 --> 17:33.170
Great God Dimple!

17:33.910 --> 17:36.150
So what?

17:37.570 --> 17:38.330
Here I go!

17:41.360 --> 17:42.830
Godly Punch!

17:46.670 --> 17:48.360
Godly Dash!

17:50.380 --> 17:51.920
And then...

17:52.410 --> 17:55.100
Godly Smash!

17:59.140 --> 18:01.670
Well? How do you like the power of God?

18:01.960 --> 18:03.230
You give up yet?

18:07.860 --> 18:10.060
Godly Throw!

18:13.240 --> 18:15.400
Godly...

18:15.910 --> 18:17.920
Sandbag!

18:20.260 --> 18:22.460
Godly Straight!

18:29.700 --> 18:31.740
I'm very aware, Shigeo...

18:32.600 --> 18:36.580
That this isn't enough to beat you.

18:39.620 --> 18:41.660
But you should be at your limit soon...

18:41.960 --> 18:44.360
The tremendous power that we sucked from him

18:44.360 --> 18:46.650
is flowing into me through the Divine Tree.

18:47.650 --> 18:51.140
I saw the limit of his power
when he fought Claw's boss.

18:51.440 --> 18:54.210
His power isn't endless. It's finite.

18:55.330 --> 18:59.020
He did almost lose to Mogami
Keiji's mental attacks, too.

18:59.350 --> 19:01.370
He's not invincible!

19:02.750 --> 19:07.090
I know how to defeat Kageyama
Shigeo more than any...

19:07.090 --> 19:08.890
That's your true form?

19:10.880 --> 19:15.970
That's your true identity?
You can't be serious.

19:15.970 --> 19:19.460
Hmph. Don't worry.
I'll shut you up in a second!

19:19.980 --> 19:23.640
I'll make you regret not
coming over to this side!

19:23.640 --> 19:25.950
Is that what you really think?

19:27.130 --> 19:30.660
Then you shouldn't be holding back.

19:31.160 --> 19:35.860
Your powers, your actions, your words...

19:35.860 --> 19:37.780
They're all fake.

19:38.410 --> 19:41.370
Don't try to convince me
that's the real Dimple.

19:42.160 --> 19:43.240
It's just...

19:43.770 --> 19:47.950
It doesn't suit you. I won't allow it.
I won't accept it.

19:52.010 --> 19:54.890
Who the hell do you think you are?!

19:55.290 --> 19:57.450
You won't accept it?!

19:57.450 --> 20:04.140
Don't go casually denying the thing
I've been wanting so badly!

20:04.800 --> 20:08.250
Godly Beam!

20:18.960 --> 20:21.930
Sh-Shit! I used too much energy!

20:22.550 --> 20:23.100
Shigeo—

20:25.270 --> 20:28.610
I-I can feel his rage.

20:31.970 --> 20:33.450
W-Wait, wait...

20:34.060 --> 20:39.590
That bastard still... He still
has this much power left?

20:44.100 --> 20:46.380
I need to finish him off
before he gets to me.

20:49.370 --> 20:51.550
That one was actually surprising.

20:52.010 --> 20:53.980
I might've almost died.

20:54.550 --> 20:57.950
A little more and I really
might lose all faith in you.

21:00.380 --> 21:04.480
This is terrifying...
He's glaring at me with those eyes.

21:04.850 --> 21:10.220
I just want to know how you really
feel. Say something, Dimple.

21:10.760 --> 21:13.090
Don't give me that.

21:13.690 --> 21:18.960
I was trying to take advantage
of you from the start!

21:19.820 --> 21:22.800
I'm sad. So...

21:23.300 --> 21:25.160
is this goodbye, Dimple?

21:25.420 --> 21:26.440
Is he coming at me?!

21:30.690 --> 21:32.260
Behold my full psychic strength!

21:32.260 --> 21:35.790
I'm going to end this!

21:47.780 --> 21:49.500
Holy shit, that shirt is lame!

23:26.180 --> 23:29.900
Man, I never could relate to you, Shigeo.

23:29.900 --> 23:33.010
I should've been able to use our psychic
powers and had a better life.

23:33.010 --> 23:35.640
You really did know how to piss me off.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.830
Next time on <i>Mob Psycho 100 III</i> Episode 6:

23:37.830 --> 23:39.670
"Divine Tree 3 ~Dimple Is~"
